"user":{"login":"aleb","id":505582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/505582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb","html_url":"https://github.com/aleb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-10T07:41:45Z","updated_at":"2017-05-11T09:48:34Z","body":"This bug can be easily reproduced with this workspace: [bug.zip](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/files/989002/bug.zip)\r\n\r\n```\r\nab@instance:~/bug$ find .\r\n.\r\n./third_party\r\n./third_party/BUILD\r\n./WORKSPACE\r\n./algebra\r\n./algebra/rand.c\r\n./algebra/rand.h\r\n./algebra/BUILD\r\n```\r\n```\r\nab@instance:~/bug$ cat third_party/BUILD \r\npackage(default_visibility = [\"//visibility:public\"])\r\nlicenses([\"notice\"])  # Apache 2.0\r\naction_listener(\r\n    name = \"cxx_extract_kindex\",\r\n    extra_actions = [\":cxx_extra_action\"],\r\n    mnemonics = [\"CppCompile\"],\r\n)\r\nextra_action(\r\n    name = \"cxx_extra_action\",\r\n    cmd = \"pwd && find . && ls algebra/rand.c\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n```\r\nab@instance:~/bug$ cat algebra/BUILD \r\ncc_library(\r\n    name = \"algebra\",\r\n    srcs = [\"rand.c\"],\r\n    hdrs = [\"rand.h\"],\r\n    visibility = [\"//visibility:public\"],\r\n    deps = [],\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBuilding the //algebra:algebra target works fine:\r\n```\r\nab@instance-codesearch:~/bug$ blaze build //algebra:algebra\r\nWARNING: Sandboxed execution is not supported on your system and thus hermeticity of actions cannot be guaranteed. See http://bazel.build/docs/bazel-user-manual.html#sandboxing for more information. You can turn off this warning via --ignore_unsupported_sandboxing.\r\nINFO: Found 1 target...\r\nTarget //algebra:algebra up-to-date:\r\n  bazel-bin/algebra/libalgebra.a\r\n  bazel-bin/algebra/libalgebra.so\r\nINFO: Elapsed time: 4.929s, Critical Path: 0.21s\r\n```\r\nBut the same fails when using --experimental_action_listener:\r\n```\r\nab@instance-codesearch:~/bug$ bazel build --experimental_action_listener=//third_party:cxx_extract_kindex //algebra:algebra -s                                                                                                                                                        \r\nWARNING: Sandboxed execution is not supported on your system and thus hermeticity of actions cannot be guaranteed. See http://bazel.build/docs/bazel-user-manual.html#sandboxing for more information. You can turn off this warning via --ignore_unsupported_sandboxing.\r\nINFO: Found 1 target...\r\n>>>>> # //algebra:algebra [action 'Executing extra_action //third_party:cxx_extra_action on //algebra:algebra']\r\n(cd /home/ab/.cache/bazel/_bazel_ab/e5d5eff4147084eb77692387ea475a7e/execroot/bug && \\\r\n  exec env - \\\r\n    PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/local/games:/usr/games:/usr/lib/jvm/java-8-oracle/bin:/usr/lib/jvm/java-8-oracle/db/bin:/usr/lib/jvm/java-8-oracle/jre/bin \\\r\n  /bin/bash -c 'pwd && find . && ls algebra/rand.c')\r\n>>>>> # //algebra:algebra [action 'Compiling algebra/rand.c']\r\n(cd /home/ab/.cache/bazel/_bazel_ab/e5d5eff4147084eb77692387ea475a7e/execroot/bug && \\\r\n  exec env - \\\r\n  /usr/bin/gcc -U_FORTIFY_SOURCE -fstack-protector -Wall -B/usr/bin -B/usr/bin -Wunused-but-set-parameter -Wno-free-nonheap-object -fno-omit-frame-pointer -MD -MF bazel-out/local-fastbuild/bin/algebra/_objs/algebra/algebra/rand.pic.d -fPIC -iquote . -iquote bazel-out/local-fastbuild/genfiles -iquote external/bazel_tools -iquote bazel-out/local-fastbuild/genfiles/external/bazel_tools -isystem external/bazel_tools/tools/cpp/gcc3 -fno-canonical-system-headers -Wno-builtin-macro-redefined '-D__DATE__=\"redacted\"' '-D__TIMESTAMP__=\"redacted\"' '-D__TIME__=\"redacted\"' -c algebra/rand.c -o bazel-out/local-fastbuild/bin/algebra/_objs/algebra/algebra/rand.pic.o)\r\nERROR: /home/ab/bug/algebra/BUILD:3:1: Executing extra_action //third_party:cxx_extra_action on //algebra:algebra failed: Process exited with status 2 [sandboxed].\r\n/home/ab/.cache/bazel/_bazel_ab/e5d5eff4147084eb77692387ea475a7e/bazel-sandbox/0879a5d6-1403-4b13-bbd2-5c0fc9b272fa-0/execroot/bug\r\n.\r\n./bazel-out\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild/extra_actions\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild/extra_actions/third_party\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild/extra_actions/third_party/cxx_extra_action\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild/extra_actions/third_party/cxx_extra_action/algebra\r\n./bazel-out/local-fastbuild/extra_actions/third_party/cxx_extra_action/algebra/bd82cb2430ebfc2f93f43d2de99e22f8.xa\r\nls: cannot access algebra/rand.c: No such file or directory\r\nUse --strategy=cxx_extra_action=standalone to disable sandboxing for the failing actions.\r\nTarget //algebra:algebra failed to build\r\nUse --verbose_failures to see the command lines of failed build steps.\r\nINFO: Elapsed time: 0.544s, Critical Path: 0.04s\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs can be seen above, the `pwd && find . && ls algebra/rand.c` command fails because `algebra/rand.c` is missing from the `/home/ab/.cache/bazel/_bazel_ab/e5d5eff4147084eb77692387ea475a7e/bazel-sandbox/0879a5d6-1403-4b13-bbd2-5c0fc9b272fa-0/execroot/bug` directory.\r\n\r\nThis breaks Kythe.io.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/300401971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"